/P 616 0 R
/E (Counting only the TA budget. Recruiting spend is often the smallest slice of a bad hire's true cost. If training, ramp, manager time, and backfill aren't in the model, you're pricing the tip of the iceberg.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 617 0 R
/E (Treating all attrition as equal. A quit at month 14 and a quit at week 6 are different events with different price tags. Track attrition against your breakeven window, not just as an annual rate.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
